OL,3,ADozens of migrants taken to Dover after
OL,4,Amore than 30 hours at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish rescue boats were sent to
OL,7,Fcollect the migrants on Tuesday, with
OL,8,Fthe UK's Maritime and Coastguard Agency
OL,9,Fsaying they would be transferred to
OL,10,FBorder Security Command.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
