OL,3,AFrost, wind and rain forecast as autumn
OL,4,Awarmth fades for many
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigher temperatures will stage a
OL,7,Fpartial comeback at the end of the
OL,8,Fweek, however, with south-east England
OL,9,Flikely to return to the mid-20s
OL,10,FCelsius.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
