CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790142462
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham expects to find 'common ground'
OL,4,Awith Trump in first meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We've found a connection. So, I will
OL,7,Fgo with where I feel it's right, to
OL,8,Fmeet him where he is at, and search for
OL,9,Fthat common ground, which I'm sure
OL,10,Fwe'll find," the prime minister told
OL,11,Freporters on his flight to the US,
OL,12,Fadding "I'm looking forward to it."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
